ap-2 tw-bg-white-900" style="width:16.666666666666668%" data-pf="reset"><div class="tw-relative tw-w-full tw-overflow-hidden tw-border-grey-200" style="border-radius:12px;border-width:1px" data-pf="reset"><div style="width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:12px;aspect-ratio:1 / 1" class="tw-bg-gradient-to-r tw-from-grey-100 tw-to-grey-200 motion-safe:tw-animate-pulse tw-overflow-hidden tw-flex tw-flex-col" data-pf="reset"></div></div><div class="tw-w-full" data-pf="reset"><div class="tw-flex tw-w-full tw-flex-wrap tw-gap-1" style="margin-bottom:5px" data-pf="reset"></div><div class="tw-flex tw-w-full tw-flex-col" data-pf="reset"><div class="tw-mb-2 tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-text-400" style="height:calc(3em + 0.25rem)" data-pf="reset"><div class="tw-mb-1" data-pf="reset"><div class="tw-text-300 tw-font-semibold tw-line-clamp-2" style="color:var(--colors-black-900)" data-pf="reset">Cadbury 5 Star Chocolatey Bar</div></div><div class="tw-flex tw-items-center" data-pf="reset"><div class="tw-text-200 tw-font-medium tw-line-clamp-1" style="color:var(--colors-grey-800)" data-pf="reset">35.2 g</div></div></div><div class="tw-flex tw-items-center tw-justify-between" data-pf="reset"><div data-pf="reset"><div class="tw-text-300 tw-font-semibold" style="color:var(--colors-black-900)" data-pf="reset">₹20</div></div><div class="tw-rounded-md tw-font-okra tw-flex tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-flex-col tw-font-semibold tw-overflow-hidden tw-text-300 tw-px-0 tw-gap-0.5 tw-min-w-[66px] tw-min-h-[32px] tw-bg-green-050 tw-border tw-border-base-green tw-text-base-green" style="padding-bottom:4px;padding-top:4px" tabindex="0" role="button" data-pf="reset"><div class="" data-pf="reset">ADD</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="PdpSeoContainerstyles__Container-sc-zmp1th-0 diLdzd"><div class="PdpSeoContainerstyles__ContentContainer-sc-zmp1th-1 hkjnHd"><h1>Buy Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk Mini Treats Milk Chocolate Pack Online</h1><p><br></p><p>Treat yourself and your loved ones to the rich, smooth and creamy taste of <strong>Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk Mini Treats Milk Chocolate Pack</strong>. Made for those who enjoy the indulgent taste of milk chocolate, these mini treats bring the classic Cadbury Dairy Milk experience in convenient bite-sized portions. With 17 pieces in the pack, there is a sweet treat to share with everyone in the family.</p><p><br></p><p>If you enjoy exploring more chocolate treats, you can also try <a href="https://blinkit.com/prn/cadbury-5-star-mini-treats-filled-bar-chocolate-pack/prid/23790" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Cadbury 5 Star Mini Treats Filled Bar Chocolate Pack</a> or explore the <a href="https://blinkit.com/prn/cadbury-5-star-filled-bar-chocolate-pack/prid/548961" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Cadbury 5 Star Filled Bar Chocolate Pack</a> for a delicious chocolate-filled experience.</p><h2><br></h2><h2>Why Choose Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk Mini Treats Milk Chocolate Pack?</h2><p><br></p><p><strong>Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk Mini Treats Milk Chocolate Pack</strong> combines the familiar taste of Cadbury Dairy Milk with the rich and creamy experience associated with Silk. </p><p>The mini chocolate pieces make it easy to enjoy a little indulgence whenever you want.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>Rich and Creamy Milk Chocolate</h3><p><br></p><p>Made with milk solids, cocoa butter and cocoa solids, these mini milk chocolate treats offer a rich and creamy chocolate experience in every bite.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>Perfect for Sharing</h3><p><br></p><p>With 17 pieces in the pack, these mini chocolates are ideal for sharing with family, friends and guests. They can be enjoyed during celebrations, gatherings or casual </p><p>moments at home.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>A Treat for Every Family Member</h3><p><br></p><p>The convenient mini format makes it easy for everyone to enjoy their own bite of chocolate. Keep them handy for sweet cravings or share them during special </p><p>occasions.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>Great for Gifting</h3><p><br></p><p>The pack can be a thoughtful chocolate gift option for birthdays, get-togethers and other celebrations. The individually portioned mini treats make sharing simple and enjoyable.</p><p><br></p><h2>Key Features of Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk Mini Treats Milk Chocolate Pack</h2><p><br></p><ul><li>Rich and creamy milk chocolate</li><li>Classic Cadbury Dairy Milk taste</li><li>Convenient mini chocolate treats</li><li>Pack contains 17 pieces</li><li>Perfect for sharing with family and friends</li><li>Suitable for gifting on special occasions</li><li>Made with milk solids, cocoa butter and cocoa solids</li><li>Made with 100% sustainably sourced cocoa</li><li>Suitable for vegetarians</li><li>Indulgent, smooth and creamy chocolate experience</li></ul><h2><br></h2><h2>A Delicious Chocolate Experience</h2><p><br></p><p><strong>Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk Mini Treats Milk Chocolate Pack</strong> is all about enjoying the richness and creaminess of chocolate in a convenient mini format. Each piece delivers the indulgent taste of milk chocolate, making it a delightful option for satisfying sweet cravings.</p><p><br></p><p>Whether you enjoy chocolate after a meal, during a break or while relaxing at home, these mini treats are easy to enjoy. Their small size also makes them convenient for sharing at family gatherings, parties and celebrations.</p><h2><br></h2><h2>Perfect for Sharing and Celebrations</h2><p><br></p><p>Chocolate is a simple way to make everyday moments feel special. With 17 mini treats in the pack, <strong>Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk Mini Treats Milk Chocolate Pack</strong> is well </p><p>suited for sharing.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>For Family Gatherings</h3><p><br></p><p>Place the mini chocolates on a serving platter and let everyone enjoy a piece of their choice.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>For Parties and Get-Togethers</h3><p><br></p><p>These bite-sized milk chocolates can be served at birthdays, get-togethers and casual celebrations.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>For Gifting</h3><p><br></p><p>The pack can be offered as a sweet chocolate gift for friends, family members or guests on special occasions.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>For Everyday Indulgence</h3><p><br></p><p>Keep the mini treats handy whenever you want to enjoy the rich, smooth and creamy taste of Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk.</p><h2><br></h2><h2>Ingredients</h2><p><br></p><p>The ingredients listed for <strong>Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk Mini Treats Milk Chocolate Pack</strong> are:</p><p><br></p><ul><li>Sugar</li><li>Milk Solids (25%*)</li><li>Cocoa Butter</li><li>Cocoa Solids</li><li>Emulsifiers (442, 476)</li><li>Flavours (Natural, Nature Identical and Artificial (Vanilla) Flavouring Substances)</li></ul><h3><br></h3><h3>Allergen Information</h3><p><br></p><p>Contains Milk.</p><p><br></p><p>May contain Tree Nuts, Wheat, Barley and Soy.</p><p><br></p><p>If you have a food allergy or intolerance, always check the product packaging for the latest allergen information before consumption.</p><h2><br></h2><h2>Nutritional Information (Per 100 g)</h2><p><br></p><ul><li><strong>Energy:</strong> 543 kcal</li><li><strong>Protein:</strong> 7.6 g</li><li><strong>Total Carbohydrates:</strong> 58.5 g</li><li><strong>Total Sugar:</strong> 55.3 g</li><li><strong>Added Sugars:</strong> 45.9 g</li><li><strong>Total Fat:</strong> 31.4 g</li><li><strong>Saturated Fat:</strong> 21.5 g</li><li><strong>Trans Fat:</strong> 0.1 g</li><li><strong>Cholesterol:</strong> 26.7 mg</li><li><strong>Sodium:</strong> 125 mg</li></ul><h2><br></h2><h2>How to Enjoy Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk Mini Treats?</h2><h3><br></h3><h3>Enjoy on Its Own</h3><p><br></p><p>Open a mini treat and savour the rich, smooth and creamy milk chocolate whenever you have a sweet craving.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>Share with Loved Ones</h3><p><br></p><p>The mini pieces are perfect for sharing with family and friends during casual moments or celebrations.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>Serve at Special Occasions</h3><p><br></p><p>Add these chocolate treats to your party table or serve them during birthdays, get-togethers and festive celebrations.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>Give as a Chocolate Gift</h3><p><br></p><p>The pack can be used as a convenient gifting option for chocolate lovers on special occasions.</p><h2><br></h2><h2>Product Information</h2><p><br></p><ul><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk Mini Treats Milk Chocolate Pack</li><li><strong>Chocolate Type:</strong> Milk Chocolate</li><li><strong>Pack Size:</strong> 17 pcs</li><li><strong>Alternate Unit:</strong> 15 pcs</li><li><strong>Unit:</strong> 135 g</li><li><strong>Serve Size:</strong> 9 g</li><li><strong>Shelf Life:</strong> 12 months</li><li><strong>Country of Origin:</strong> India</li><li><strong>FSSAI License:</strong> 10014022002711</li><li><strong>Suitable For:</strong> Vegetarians</li></ul><h2><br></h2><h2>Why Shop from Blinkit?</h2><h3><br></h3><h3>Round The Clock Delivery</h3><p><br></p><p>Get your favourite chocolates and everyday essentials delivered to your doorstep from dark stores near you whenever you need them.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>Best Prices &amp; Offers</h3><p><br></p><p>Shop for chocolates, snacks and other everyday products at competitive prices with offers available from time to time.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>Wide Assortment</h3><p><br></p><p>Choose from a wide range of products across food, personal care, household and other categories, making everyday shopping simple and convenient.</p><h2><br></h2><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><h3><br></h3><h3>What is Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk Mini Treats Milk Chocolate Pack?</h3><p><br></p><p>It is a pack of mini milk chocolate treats offering the rich, smooth and creamy taste associated with Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>How many pieces are in the pack?</h3><p><br></p><p>The listed pack size contains 17 pieces.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>What type of chocolate is it?</h3><p><br></p><p>Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk Mini Treats are milk chocolates.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>How much does the pack weigh?</h3><p><br></p><p>The listed unit size is 135 g.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>Is Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk Mini Treats suitable for vegetarians?</h3><p><br></p><p>Yes, the product description states that it is suitable for vegetarians.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>Does the chocolate contain milk?</h3><p><br></p><p>Yes. The allergen information states that the product contains milk.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>Can it be used for gifting?</h3><p><br></p><p>Yes. The mini milk chocolate pack is suitable for gifting on occasions such as birthdays and get-togethers.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>Can I share these chocolates with family and friends?</h3><p><br></p><p>Yes. The mini treat format and 17-piece pack make it convenient for sharing with family and friends.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>What is the serving size?</h3><p><br></p><p>The listed serving size is 9 g.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>What is the shelf life of the product?</h3><p><br></p><p>The listed shelf life of Cadbury Dairy Milk Silk Mini Treats Milk Chocolate Pack is 12 months.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div></div><div class="containers__Divider-sc-l8pmj8-1 bzZIsM"></div></div></div><div class="Footer__FooterContainer-sc-14h3h0g-0 iZBVAQ"><footer class="Footer__Wrapper-sc-14h3h0g-3 cwIfVL"><div class="FooterLinks__Grid-sc-12rhzht-0 hyzNyz"><div><div class="FooterLinks__ListHeading-sc-12rhzht-1 aonOx">Useful Links</div><ul type="col" class="FooterLinks__List-sc-12rhzht-2 fBgyNM"><li class="FooterLinks__ListItem-sc-12rhzht-3 BvTiN"><ul type="col" class="FooterLinks__List-sc-12rhzht-2 jqmuYk"><li class="FooterLinks__ListItem-sc-12rhzht-3 BvTiN"><a href="/blog" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="FooterLinkshelpers__FooterLink-sc-f4rm2u-0 cmyjwV">Blog</a></li><li class="FooterLinks__ListItem-sc-12rhzht-3 BvTiN"><a href="/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="FooterLinkshelpers__FooterLink-sc-f4rm2u-0 cmyjwV">Privacy</a></li><li class="FooterLinks__ListItem-sc-12rhzht-3 BvTiN"